%% Distributed Transaction Flow
%% Commit SHA: 6ca473a526d30cccd2d55ea87a6bf4bd22db3e40

sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant TCS as TxnCoordSender
    participant Int as Interceptors
    participant DS as DistSender
    participant R as Replica
    participant Raft as Raft Group

    App->>TCS: Begin Transaction

    Note over TCS: Create transaction record<br/>Start heartbeat

    App->>TCS: Put(key1, val1)
    TCS->>Int: Process through stack
    Note over Int: 1. Heartbeater<br/>2. SeqNumAllocator<br/>3. Pipeliner<br/>4. SpanRefresher
    Int->>DS: Route to range
    DS->>R: Send BatchRequest
    R->>Raft: Propose
    Raft-->>R: Committed
    R-->>DS: Write Intent Created
    DS-->>Int: Response
    Int-->>TCS: Pipelined OK

    App->>TCS: Put(key2, val2)
    Note over TCS,R: Similar flow for second write

    App->>TCS: Commit
    TCS->>Int: Parallel Commit
    Note over Int: Committer interceptor<br/>batches writes + STAGING
    Int->>DS: BatchRequest + EndTxn
    DS->>R: Send to ranges
    R->>Raft: Propose commit
    Raft-->>R: Committed
    R-->>DS: COMMITTED status
    DS-->>Int: Success
    Int-->>TCS: Transaction committed
    TCS-->>App: Commit OK

    Note over R: Async intent resolution
